# Frontend Technical Documentation

## Khor Beauty Aesthetics Website

---

# 1. Frontend Overview

The frontend is built using a modern React-based architecture powered by Next.js App Router.

The purpose of the frontend is to provide:

* Responsive website UI
* Luxury aesthetic branding experience
* Booking interaction
* Service showcase
* Contact & inquiry pages
* Reusable component-based architecture

The frontend follows a scalable production-ready structure suitable for future SaaS-level expansion.

---

# 2. Frontend Technology Stack

| Technology       | Purpose                      |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------- |
| Next.js          | React framework              |
| React            | UI rendering                 |
| TypeScript (TSX) | Typed frontend development   |
| Tailwind CSS     | Utility-first styling        |
| shadcn/ui        | Reusable UI component system |
| Turbopack        | Development bundler          |
| PostCSS          | CSS processing               |
| Google Fonts     | Typography system            |

