# 11. Tailwind CSS Usage

Example:

```tsx
className="
flex
items-center
justify-between
px-8
py-4
bg-white/70
backdrop-blur-md
"
```

Purpose:

| Class            | Meaning                     |
| ---------------- | --------------------------- |
| flex             | Flexbox layout              |
| items-center     | Vertical alignment          |
| justify-between  | Horizontal spacing          |
| px-8             | Horizontal padding          |
| py-4             | Vertical padding            |
| bg-white/70      | Semi-transparent background |
| backdrop-blur-md | Glass blur effect           |

